  "whatsNew.title": "What's New in {version}?",
  "whatsNew.showOnStartup": "Show on startup",
  "whatsNew.placeholderShot": "Screenshot placeholder",
  "whatsNew.fallbackTitle": "What's New?",
  "whatsNew.fallbackCopy": "A detailed changelog template is not available for this version yet, but the app detected a new build.",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.heroTitle": "A smoother, faster DDMX for building and running your show.",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.heroCopy": "Version 0.3.0 focuses on the real workflow: running long cue lists more reliably, building timing live with CTC, importing smarter effects, and making the desktop app feel cleaner from startup to playback.",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.heroBadge1": "Smoother playback",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.heroBadge2": "Faster cue building",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.heroBadge3": "Cleaner desktop app",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.playbackTitle": "Run cue lists with more confidence",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.playbackCopy": "Playback has been reworked to feel more stable on longer shows and more predictable during live operation.",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.playbackBullet1": "Play, pause, skip and play-from behave more cleanly during cue-list playback.",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.playbackBullet2": "Playback speed presets let you slow down or speed up a sequence on purpose.",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.playbackBullet3": "Short waits and short fades are handled more cleanly.",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.playbackBullet4": "Status feedback in the cue list is easier to follow while the show runs.",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.ctcTitle": "New feature: Cue Time Creator",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.ctcCopy": "CTC is a new tool for building cue timing live. Start a cue list, listen to the music or watch the sequence, then press your key at the right moments to create empty cues with captured timing.",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.ctcBullet1": "Great for quickly sketching the rhythm and structure of a show before filling the cues.",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.ctcBullet2": "Dedicated settings let you enable it, choose the keybind and monitor it while it runs.",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.ctcBullet3": "Capture on key press and on key release is available for more musical workflows.",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.ctcBullet4": "CTC can continue after playback ends until you stop it yourself.",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.fxTitle": "Bring custom intelligent effects with your show",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.fxCopy": "Custom intelligent effects are easier to carry across playback modes, not just preview inside the UI.",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.fxBullet1": "A new shared JSON format can describe intelligent effects once.",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.fxBullet2": "The same imported effect can now be understood by both the UI and the backend runner.",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.fxBullet3": "Haut/Bas was corrected to behave like a real high/low pulse effect with timing controls.",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.uiTitle": "A cleaner app for setup and playback",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.uiCopy": "Several parts of the interface were reorganized to feel more practical during real use.",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.uiBullet1": "Playback controls are grouped more logically inside the cue-list area.",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.uiBullet2": "Settings start in a simpler view, with advanced options hidden by default.",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.uiBullet3": "GUI-safe custom modals reduce odd popup behavior.",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.uiBullet4": "Desktop startup now feels cleaner, with a proper splash and more controlled loading.",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.otherTitle": "Under the hood",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.otherCopy": "The engine also received timing and startup work in the background, but the goal was simple: make the app feel more solid in everyday use.",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.otherBullet1": "Version and license are now visible directly in settings.",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.otherBullet2": "Playback state is reflected more clearly in the interface.",
  "whatsNew.0_3_0.otherBullet3": "Multi-selection cue moves behave more consistently.",
